{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014gEwCui9RYVsfPNiyeGJie","type":"tool_result","content":"docs-site/docs/architecture.md:249:`--changed-from/--changed-to` selects the minimum safe check set from\ndocs-site/docs/capability-assessment.md:257:additive `--json`/`--junit`/`--sarif` emission; deterministic changed-scope\ndocs-site/docs/capability-assessment.md:258:selection (`--changed-from/--changed-to`) over declared dependency edges with\ndocs-site/docs/capability-assessment.md:267:stacks, standard result formats, timeouts/isolation, changed-scope selection,\ndocs-site/docs/cli.md:60:| `pose validate [--strict\\|--tolerant] [--stack s] [--module p\\|--workspace w\\|--root-only] [--changed-from A --changed-to B] [--explain] [--report [--report-task T]] [--json-out P] [--junit P] [--sarif P] [--emit-plan P]` | Run the validation matrix; `--report` writes a report that lists the commands this run executed and its result |\ndocs-site/docs/concepts.md:98:evidence — `pose doctor` reports both. `--changed-from/--changed-to` selects\ndocs-site/docs/monorepo-recipes.md:13:--changed-from` turns those inputs into a minimum safe selection (see\ndocs-site/docs/monorepo-recipes.md:46:pose validate --changed-from HEAD --explain\ndocs-site/docs/monorepo-recipes.md:50:[changed-scope] HEAD..worktree: 1 changed file(s), 2/2 module(s) selected\ndocs-site/docs/monorepo-recipes.md:93:pose validate --changed-from HEAD --explain\ndocs-site/docs/monorepo-recipes.md:136:pose validate --changed-from HEAD --explain --json-out result.json\ndocs-site/docs/monorepo-recipes.md:151:`result.json` with the changed-scope reason, never silently dropped.\ndocs-site/docs/product-roadmaps.md:141:effectiveness, changed-scope validation and bounded execution. These features"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"d2ac8c97-7f48-43c5-a6ad-8fa3a8da9bf5","timestamp":"2026-11-27T17:36:19.945Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"f